  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5401.11 “Report of investigation (ROI)” is a report generated by the investigator. The ROI contains a summary of the facts and data gathered during the investigation and the recommendation of the investigator for resolution of the complaint.\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
